  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>What's better than a causality-defying magazine with infinite ammo? Two of them!</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dragoon clip technique, dragoon as a chosen triggerman specialization, triggerman level 7th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your dragoon clip technique now grants you two dragoon clips rather than only one; however, the sheer bulk of a dragoon clip means that you may not have both of them attached to the same firearm at any one time. Further, you may only have up to one escalated dragoon clip attached to your firearms at any one time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
